{"id":"n23390-1-9","stage":5,"title":"개편 · 改编","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23390-1-9-1","ko":"정부가 새로운 행정 구역 개편 방안을 발표하였습니다.","zh":"政府已经公布了新的行政区划调整方案。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정부가","meaning":"政府","explanation":"정부：政府；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정부","audio":"/audio/e471387df97978e2d0ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31749","senseId":"2","lemma":"정부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정부가","audio":"/audio/ef9a0da8e13a44f8a361.mp3"}},{"text":"새로운","meaning":"新","explanation":"새롭다：新；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"새롭다","audio":"/audio/0dd73a3ec78548995542.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29029","senseId":"1","lemma":"새롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로운","audio":"/audio/e385dcc20a68fd498495.mp3"}},{"text":"행정","meaning":"行政","explanation":"행정：行政","readings":[{"term":"행정","audio":"/audio/a4f24ba76b27ac585486.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85188","senseId":"2","lemma":"행정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"행정","audio":"/audio/a4f24ba76b27ac585486.mp3"}},{"text":"구역","meaning":"区域","explanation":"구역：区域","readings":[{"term":"구역","audio":"/audio/366e0bfa41c1dcd36a2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24546","senseId":"1","lemma":"구역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구역","audio":"/audio/366e0bfa41c1dcd36a2d.mp3"}},{"text":"개편","meaning":"改编，改版，改组","explanation":"개편：改编，改版，改组","readings":[{"term":"개편","audio":"/audio/be6d4c107e664d12abcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23390","senseId":"1","lemma":"개편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개편","audio":"/audio/be6d4c107e664d12abcb.mp3"}},{"text":"방안을","meaning":"方案","explanation":"방안：方案；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"방안","audio":"/audio/ed5a31c84d7d11c5032b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15894","senseId":"1","lemma":"방안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방안을","audio":"/audio/ab295b8365e8e8f4f184.mp3"}},{"text":"발표하였습니다.","meaning":"发表，公布","explanation":"발표하다：发表，公布；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"발표하다","audio":"/audio/7557bfef04fa748f00e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66270","senseId":"1","lemma":"발표하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발표하였습니다","audio":"/audio/092703ed328212cdf525.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e471387df97978e2","term":"정부","zh":"政府","audio":"/audio/e471387df97978e2d0ff.mp3","entryId":"31749","definition":"负责行政的国家机构。","pronunciation":["정부"]},{"id":"0dd73a3ec7854899","term":"새롭다","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/0dd73a3ec78548995542.mp3","entryId":"29029","definition":"与至今为止的东西不同或不曾存在过。","pronunciation":["새롭따"]},{"id":"a4f24ba76b27ac58","term":"행정","zh":"行政","audio":"/audio/a4f24ba76b27ac585486.mp3","entryId":"85188","definition":"政府依法行使的统治行为。","pronunciation":["행정"]},{"id":"366e0bfa41c1dcd3","term":"구역","zh":"区域","audio":"/audio/366e0bfa41c1dcd36a2d.mp3","entryId":"24546","definition":"按照一定基准或特性划分的多个区中的一个。","pronunciation":["구역"]},{"id":"be6d4c107e664d12","term":"개편","zh":"改编，改版，改组","audio":"/audio/be6d4c107e664d12abcb.mp3","entryId":"23390","definition":"修改更换后重建机构或组织、节目等。","pronunciation":["개ː편"]},{"id":"ed5a31c84d7d11c5","term":"방안","zh":"方案","audio":"/audio/ed5a31c84d7d11c5032b.mp3","entryId":"15894","definition":"处理事情的方法或计划。","pronunciation":["방안"]},{"id":"7557bfef04fa748f","term":"발표하다","zh":"发表，公布","audio":"/audio/7557bfef04fa748f00e1.mp3","entryId":"66270","definition":"向世人公开告知某种事实、结果或作品等。","pronunciation":["발표하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/49c7dfb06ec21b448618.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23390-1-9-2","ko":"네, 시와 군 등이 통합되거나 분리되면서 일부 지역 주민들은 반대 시위도 벌이고 있습니다.","zh":"是的，随着市和郡等的合并或分离，部分地区的居民还举行了反对示威。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","ori