404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"市","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"57258","definition":"以城市为中心的地方行政区域。","pronunciation":["시ː"]},{"id":"c7dbb8e1c30050fa","term":"군","zh":"郡","audio":"/audio/c7dbb8e1c30050fa73cb.mp3","entryId":"36857","definition":"在韩国道以下、邑或面以上的地方行政区域。","pronunciation":["군ː"]},{"id":"ad8c9dea07d94cab","term":"등","zh":"等，等等","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3","entryId":"49992","definition":"表示前面所说之外还有一些同类的东西。","pronunciation":["등ː"]},{"id":"d7ee11f56564774e","term":"통합되다","zh":"被合并，被整合","audio":"/audio/d7ee11f56564774e13e1.mp3","entryId":"81926","definition":"多个机构或组织等被合而为一。","pronunciation":["통ː합뙤다","통ː합뛔다"]},{"id":"dea01682000309c8","term":"분리되다","zh":"被分离，被分开","audio":"/audio/dea01682000309c8897e.mp3","entryId":"21089","definition":"被相互分隔开来。","pronunciation":["불리되다","불리뒈다"]},{"id":"32555f5ba712b1fd","term":"일부","zh":"一部分","audio":"/audio/32555f5ba712b1fdaf74.mp3","entryId":"62599","definition":"一部分；或指全部中的一些。","pronunciation":["일부"]},{"id":"770eb9e292c17199","term":"지역","zh":"地域，地区，区域","audio":"/audio/770eb9e292c171999d24.mp3","entryId":"71487","definition":"根据某个特征或一定的标准划分其范围的地方。","pronunciation":["지역"]},{"id":"fad44df7206bfa76","term":"주민","zh":"居民","audio":"/audio/fad44df7206bfa767dc2.mp3","entryId":"25948","definition":"住在某一区域内的人。","pronunciation":["주ː민"]},{"id":"8b41caa49fef042d","term":"반대","zh":"反对","audio":"/audio/8b41caa49fef042da7ee.mp3","entryId":"69484","definition":"不赞成并违抗某种行为或意见等。","pronunciation":["반ː대"]},{"id":"643c70cb0350f86a","term":"시위","zh":"示威","audio":"/audio/643c70cb0350f86ad4e7.mp3","entryId":"13970","definition":"许多人提出要求条件，通过集会或游行表明意见的活动。","pronunciation":["시ː위"]},{"id":"142c90c40189964b","term":"벌이다","zh":"进行，开展","audio":"/audio/142c90c40189964b7c4b.mp3","entryId":"59072","definition":"有计划地开始或展开某事。","pronunciation":["버ː리다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/810454afa5e82b25785b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":6.283,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=23390","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":178,"sequenceScore":6.1097,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["政府已经公布了新的行政区划调整方案。","是的，随着市和郡等的合并或分离，部分地区的居民还举行了反对示威。","据说把废弃物偷偷排入下水道的工厂厂长被警察抓了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["政府已经公布了新的行政区划调整方案。","是的，随着市和郡等的合并或分离，部分地区的居民还举行了反对示威。","据说把废弃物偷偷排入下水道的工厂厂长被警察抓了。"],"answer":1}]}
